1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,796
People screenshot tickets. Scalpers flip them.

2
00:00:02,796 --> 00:00:07,296
The host mints a ticket with a 1 NEAR cap and a 5% royalty.

3
00:00:07,296 --> 00:00:10,644
List over the cap, and the contract rejects it.

4
00:00:10,644 --> 00:00:15,912
Fair sale. 0.95 to the seller. 0.05 to the host.

5
00:00:15,912 --> 00:00:19,380
The door admits the owner. The old one is denied.

6
00:00:19,380 --> 00:00:23,808
Check in, and it becomes a Was There souvenir. Returning guest.

7
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:29,172
Use it here, on your phone. Here, on your iPad. And here, on your computer.

8
00:00:28,907 --> 00:00:34,891
near-private-tickets.netlify.app. Built on NEAR.

